WEBVTT

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.230
Flying in the sky

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.360
<i>takaku habatake</i>
Soar high up

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:10.110
<i>oozora o dokomade mo</i>
Anywhere across the sky

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.940
Shining Finger

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.820
<i>kagayaku hikari ga</i>
The shining light

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>chi no hate terashi kiseki o yobu spell</i>
A spell that spreads
miracles throughout the world

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:20.660
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:26.330
<i>furimukazu aruku no sa</i>
Walk forward and never turn back

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:32.590
<i>mugen no chikara ga aru</i>
I have an unlimited power

00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:40.010
<i>nando demo tamesu no sa</i>
I must test myself many times

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:48.350
<i>donna ni kurushikutemo yaritogeru</i>
Do it all no matter how painful

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.650
<i>ai wa itsumo kono mune ni</i>
Love is always in my heart

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:55.150
<i>towa ni kieru koto wa nai</i>
It will never fade

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:58.240
<i>kono te ga sakendeiru</i>
My hand cries out loud

00:00:58.240 --> 00:01:02.240
<i>ashita e to hashire</i>
To run toward tomorrow

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:04.000
Bright you now

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:08.500
<i>kimi ga egaita mirai e no shinario wa</i>
The future that you envision

00:01:09.330 --> 00:01:10.840
Shining Finger

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:12.500
<i>yume o tsukamou</i>
Take hold of our dreams

00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:16.050
<i>subete wa omou mama ni I get a chance</i>
Everything will go
my way if I get a chance

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:31.900
Halt!

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:34.320
You're not authorized
to cross the border!

00:01:34.780 --> 00:01:37.450
This is a warning!
Halt! Halt!

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:53.870
On this day, a shuttle tears past
the Neo France border...

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:57.000
Space Colony Neo France


00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.460
...and heads toward Earth.

00:01:57.470 --> 00:01:59.360
Its destination is the
the Guyana Highlands.

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:01.510
And its target is an area...

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:05.020
...where we'll find George,
also from Neo France.

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:08.680
As one storm brews up
another storm...

00:02:08.680 --> 00:02:12.230
...his opponent is the vengeful
Jean-Pierre Mirabeau!

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:13.360
And now!

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:18.400
Gundam Fight!
Ready! Go!

00:02:18.400 --> 00:02:24.490
George, Beat the Nightmare!

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.300
That's enough, Raymond.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:40.260
I knew you just wouldn't do.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.380
Nonsense!

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:44.140
I'm Raymond, your butler...

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:47.470
...and I don't take my 45 years
with the de Sand Family lightly.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:48.560
We'll go on!

00:02:49.020 --> 00:02:49.810
But...

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.060
Nonsense!

00:02:53.730 --> 00:02:55.360
I'm not quitting yet!

00:02:58.230 --> 00:02:59.320
Please listen well.

00:02:59.650 --> 00:03:02.240
Do not forget that I was the one...

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:05.070
...who taught you how to fence!

00:03:14.750 --> 00:03:16.170
That's why I told you...

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:19.060
...that you cannot treat me
like a child anymore.

00:03:26.300 --> 00:03:28.540
Is there a problem?
Master George?

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:33.020
George?!

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:35.650
Stay away! Stay away!

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.270
Master George!

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:40.430
Stay away! Stay away from me!

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.120
George! George, sir!

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:46.700
Come to your senses!
Please! George!

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:49.200
Gundam Rose?

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:56.630
He's been ill?

00:03:56.960 --> 00:03:58.340
Yes, I'm afraid so.

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:01.890
George has not been well of late.

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:05.800
As you saw earlier, he has problems
motivating himself to train.

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:07.660
If possible...

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:11.180
...would it be too much to ask
if you would kindly examine him?

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.060
Stop it, Raymond.

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:14.770
I apologize...

00:04:14.810 --> 00:04:16.270
...for my butler.

00:04:16.560 --> 00:04:19.180
Please. I don't mind.

00:04:20.190 --> 00:04:22.540
I'm fine.
There is no need to worry.

00:04:24.880 --> 00:04:25.610
However...

00:04:26.070 --> 00:04:28.360
...your sudden arrival here
is curious.

00:04:28.820 --> 00:04:30.700
One cannot help
being suspicious.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.250
But why...?

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:34.210
Did you two talk this over earlier?

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.420
I just remembered that
I have to be somewhere.

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.590
Thanks for the snack!

00:04:44.590 --> 00:04:45.340
Not fair...

00:04:45.340 --> 00:04:46.090
Raymond!

00:04:46.470 --> 00:04:47.300
Y-yes, sir!

00:04:49.100 --> 00:04:50.510
Have you been meeting with her?

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:53.100
I-I'm terribly sorry.

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:55.350
Without talking to me first.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:04.040
I heard that Domon Kasshu has
come to an impasse as well.

00:05:04.040 --> 00:05:06.820
I thought that
by working together...

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:09.240
...you might be able to overcome
your respective problems.

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.120
Enough! You may go!

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:12.850
Yes, sir.

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.060
Still no good...

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:49.690
What do I have to do to be able to
control the Super Mode at will?!

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:57.580
Nicely done!

00:05:57.740 --> 00:05:58.580
Who's there?!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:01.320
Very impressive,
Mr. Domon Kasshu.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:02.670
You avoided that well!

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:04.750
Hey, you're Neo France's...

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:12.720
I've come to see you because
I am obliged to ask a favor of you.

00:06:13.300 --> 00:06:14.350
What kind of favor?

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:20.600
This is all for my Master George.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:24.360
Raymond.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:26.600
Where are you?

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:29.820
Answer me, Raymond.

00:06:34.780 --> 00:06:35.570
Why, that's...

00:06:40.960 --> 00:06:42.330
Miss Maria Louise!

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:49.670
Miss Maria Lou...

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:03.770
Miss Maria Louise!

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:29.800
That same dream again.

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:31.550
Raymond!

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:33.800
Raymond!

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.510
Raymond!

00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:45.100
But that's a
Gundam Fight data file.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.360
Indeed.

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:49.940
All combat data on Master George
has been recorded here.

00:07:50.400 --> 00:07:52.100
What're you thinking?

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:55.160
You'll be in a lot of trouble if he
finds out you brought that here.

00:07:55.620 --> 00:07:56.910
I understand.

00:07:58.120 --> 00:08:01.610
However, I do this because
I care greatly about George.

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:07.750
This is George in a recent
Gundam Fight match.

00:08:24.600 --> 00:08:27.060
Is this really the George we know?

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:29.820
It's like he's possessed
by something.

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.320
In fact, there's good reason
for this behavior.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:34.650
Yes.

00:08:34.650 --> 00:08:36.530
It happened about one year ago.

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:41.490
At the finals to decide the Fighter
who would represent Neo France.

00:08:45.420 --> 00:08:46.960
Turning your back
on your opponent?!

00:08:47.380 --> 00:08:49.250
In that case, Rose Bits!

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:53.370
George's opponent was Mirabeau.

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:55.930
He always moved in front
of the stands...

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.450
...so that the Gundam Rose
could not use any weapons.

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:01.810
Can't do anything, huh?

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:03.430
The coward!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:05.940
Anything to attain victory!

00:09:15.240 --> 00:09:16.280
It's game over!

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:19.370
Stop!

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.450
Mirabeau!

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:26.000
Your atrocious fighting style
has been a constant eyesore!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.170
Therefore, the Gundam Fighter
George de Sand...

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.040
...shall represent our nation!

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.670
How dare you!

00:09:34.340 --> 00:09:35.880
Stop!

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:14.940
The Marseilles tragedy.
I've heard of it.

00:10:17.380 --> 00:10:19.300
Mirabeau was spared...

00:10:19.300 --> 00:10:23.010
...and sentenced to 1,000 years
for his crime against the nation.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:28.040
And George has made every effort
to forget that incident, but...

00:10:28.770 --> 00:10:30.790
...the shock from encountering
the Devil Gundam...

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:33.560
...must've reopened
old emotional scars.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:36.690
So? What do you want me to do?

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:39.110
Bring back his soul.

00:10:39.110 --> 00:10:42.160
To guide dear George back
on the path with a Gundam Fight.

00:10:42.160 --> 00:10:43.780
There's no need for that.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:48.660
Master George...

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.520
I overheard everything
that was said here.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:55.250
I never expected you to
disobey my orders like that.

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.800
As a Neo France Fighter...

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:58.760
No.

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:00.600
In the name of the de Sand Family...

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:03.640
...you, Raymond Bishop,
are dismissed!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:07.640
M-Master George...

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:25.830
Mobile Fighter G Gundam

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:34.750
Forty-five years as a butler.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:38.590
I, who even changed George's
diapers when he was a baby...

00:11:39.380 --> 00:11:40.260
...am fired?

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:44.150
Bartender! More coffee!

00:11:50.600 --> 00:11:52.940
Leave George and his butler alone.

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:55.230
It has nothing to do with us.

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:56.820
You think so?

00:11:58.780 --> 00:11:59.610
Huh?

00:11:59.780 --> 00:12:02.200
You seem to be quite popular
these days.

00:12:03.570 --> 00:12:05.190
I mean, it's not just George.

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:07.680
Chibodee, Sai Saici, and Argo...

00:12:08.330 --> 00:12:11.150
They've all come around
relying on you for help.

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:12.290
Me?

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.170
I envy you.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:15.750
Friendships among men.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.250
That's crazy.

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:20.840
<i>This just in</i>.

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:25.840
<i>The man responsible for the</i>
<i>Marseilles tragedy a year ago</i>...

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:29.720
...<i>Jean-Pierre Mirabeau,</i>
<i>has escaped from prison</i>.

00:12:29.720 --> 00:12:32.560
<i>Reports indicate that he has</i>
<i>landed on Earth</i>.

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:35.020
<i>During Mirabeau's escape</i>
<i>from the Colony</i>...

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.190
...<i>he stole a military</i>
<i>armor-type Gundam</i>...

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:38.440
- Oh, no!
...<i>and the Neo France government</i>...

00:12:38.650 --> 00:12:40.650
Master George!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:47.370
Will not even this morning light...

00:12:47.370 --> 00:12:50.160
...wash away my nightmare?

00:12:52.910 --> 00:12:53.660
Raymond?!

00:12:56.460 --> 00:12:57.670
A bird...

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:06.930
Master George.

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:08.540
It's time now for your tea.

00:13:09.720 --> 00:13:11.890
How do you like the color
of these roses?

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:15.230
George!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.350
Master George!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.560
Master George!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:21.690
Good morning!

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:23.360
Mademoiselle...

00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:27.450
And Domon Kasshu...

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:31.870
So, did Raymond really leave?

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.160
He brought shame
to the de Sand Family.

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:36.710
There's no place for him here.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:39.210
Aren't you the one
who brought shame?

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:40.130
What did you say?

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:43.130
Just because you're haunted
by visions of the Devil Gundam...

00:13:43.840 --> 00:13:47.470
...you turn coward and abandon
your spirit of chivalry.

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:50.050
You don't deserve to be
called a Gundam Fighter!

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:51.390
Domon!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:52.140
Yes.

00:13:52.760 --> 00:13:54.840
You may be right about that.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:58.350
At this moment, I'm even
afraid to pilot my Gundam.

00:13:58.730 --> 00:13:59.890
George...

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.360
What's that?!

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:07.650
That's...!

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:14.830
George de Sand.
Long time no see!

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:16.790
That's Mirabeau's voice!

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.410
I challenge you, George!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:33.930
Domon!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:36.350
Leave him alone!
This is George's fight!

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.820
This year was a long one.

00:14:41.190 --> 00:14:44.320
I hate you for swiping
my position as representative.

00:14:44.520 --> 00:14:45.730
Now...

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:48.530
...let's decide once and for all...

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:50.410
...who deserves to be
the nation's Fighter!

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:52.490
Okay, rich boy?!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:59.660
Although I may have been fired...

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:02.040
...I still shouldn't have
left my master's side!

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.960
Master George!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:29.440
Why, could that be...?!

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:36.120
Oh, my! Am I too late?!

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:40.330
Get this.

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:44.790
I'll take you out to become the
true representative of Neo France!

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.250
Now!

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.420
Die!

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:51.380
George, no!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.090
I guess I have no choice!

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:55.930
Gundam!

00:15:56.050 --> 00:15:57.260
What?!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:03.270
I'll end this right now!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:05.480
Shining Fin...!

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:06.190
Wait!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:15.030
Schwartz Bruder!
It's you again!

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.200
Why are you stopping me?!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:19.290
Stay out of it! This is his battle!

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:20.910
George de Sand!

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:24.920
If you have proof you are a
member of the Shuffle Alliance...

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.750
...that's where you'll
find your answer!

00:16:30.590 --> 00:16:31.760
I can't!

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:35.220
You spineless coward!

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:36.890
Self-recovery!

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.430
The Devil Gundam must've
infected him with DG cells!

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:40.770
Yeah.

00:16:40.770 --> 00:16:44.390
I met Master Asia as soon
as I landed.

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:47.520
As you can see,
I've sold my soul to the Devil!

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:51.230
Now...

00:16:51.230 --> 00:16:54.150
...I'll show you the power
I've acquired...

00:16:54.150 --> 00:16:55.490
...to fulfill my revenge!

00:17:09.460 --> 00:17:11.460
Die! Die!

00:17:17.090 --> 00:17:19.100
Isn't he ever going to
run out of missiles?!

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:25.230
Rain!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:31.380
Master George!

00:17:35.070 --> 00:17:36.050
Raymond, no!

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:39.200
Master George.

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:41.780
You mustn't lose!
You must still fight!

00:17:41.780 --> 00:17:45.370
And you must win against
the evil in your heart!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:50.500
Raymond!

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:01.850
You're finally ready.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:03.180
You coward!

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:09.230
I-impossible!

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:29.120
No! He's losing himself in his anger!

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:41.050
George!

00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:43.350
Die!

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:49.190
Stop it, George!

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:51.150
You already won the match!

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:56.320
If you've got any pride left in you
as a knight...

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:58.400
...don't fight any
meaningless battles!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:18:59.990
Let go of me!

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:01.910
I won't let go!

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:04.080
If you continue fighting like this...

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:08.040
...you will end up just like
that Devil Gundam!

00:19:14.090 --> 00:19:15.290
The Super Mode!

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:24.010
Calm down, George!
Calm down.

00:19:24.010 --> 00:19:25.720
- Shut up!
- Master George!

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.270
Come to your senses!

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:31.140
Raymond...

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:34.190
Please put an end to your assault!

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:36.440
Your true enemy is not Mirabeau!

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:39.600
It's the Devil that's within you!

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.870
Then I must defeat myself?

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:56.500
However...

00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:00.300
...I cannot leave him this way!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:05.240
Yes. I was beginning to forget.

00:20:05.760 --> 00:20:07.510
A Gundam Fighter is worthy...

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:10.480
...if he is guided by his heart!

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:17.950
I have a Shuffle Crest.

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:20.940
If I am worthy of this symbol...

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:24.640
...erase the spell of the
Devil Gundam from Mirabeau!

00:20:40.630 --> 00:20:43.340
I'm very proud of you, George.

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:46.810
I couldn't have beaten
the Devil within me...

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:49.850
...without your help, Raymond.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:56.190
What the...?

00:20:56.190 --> 00:20:57.940
Take a good look, Domon.

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:01.690
The fist without the heart
can only lead to destruction.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:04.700
But depending on how one
applies himself...

00:21:04.700 --> 00:21:06.240
...one can create something amazing.

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:11.080
Yes.
Great power has two opposing sides.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:12.580
A proverbial double-edged sword.

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:15.860
Which will you choose?

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:20.570
I...

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.170
Are you certain, sir?

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:28.310
You don't mind someone like me
once again being your butler?

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:32.430
You're the only one capable of
being butler to the de Sand Family.

00:21:32.970 --> 00:21:34.140
Am I not right?

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:35.880
Master George...

00:21:39.310 --> 00:21:40.870
George!

00:21:46.990 --> 00:21:50.490
It's nice to see things are
back to normal with those two.

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:52.830
Hey, how about that Super Mode?

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:54.250
I don't know.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:56.870
My Super Mode...

00:21:56.870 --> 00:22:00.040
...doesn't seem to want to be
controlled that easily.

00:22:00.500 --> 00:22:01.230
Domon...

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.210
But...

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:05.210
...I'm starting to learn
a little about it.

00:22:05.210 --> 00:22:08.510
So the important thing
is to continue training!

00:22:28.660 --> 00:22:33.280
<i>Ikusen no tsukihi ga nagaretemo</i>
No matter how much time passes

00:22:33.660 --> 00:22:37.660
<i>tadori tsukenu basho o</i>
There's a place I can never reach

00:22:37.960 --> 00:22:42.130
<i>samayoi motomenagara</i>
As I wander, continuing my search

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:45.670
<i>aruite yuku</i>
I keep going forward

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:52.850
<i>koibito yo,</i>
watashi no hitomi no oku de
Deep within my stare, my love

00:22:53.350 --> 00:22:58.560
<i>kasuka ni yureteiru shinjitsu ga</i>
There is a truth that gently floats

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:03.820
<i>dore hodo tsutawaru no desho</i>
How much of it will you catch?

00:23:03.980 --> 00:23:10.360
<i>Kizutsuita kokoro to karada azukete</i>
Give me your injured body and spirit

00:23:10.740 --> 00:23:14.490
<i>atataka na kono mune de</i>
I will hold you against my warm heart

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:20.500
<i>umi yori mo fukaku nemutte</i>
So you can sleep deeper than the sea

00:23:31.840 --> 00:23:33.930
Everyone, it's the moment
you've been waiting for!

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:37.390
The Final Battle begins
in a few days.

00:23:37.390 --> 00:23:39.980
But Domon has yet to
complete his training.

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:45.190
And the Death Army launches an
attack on Chibodee and the others.

00:23:45.690 --> 00:23:50.150
Will the Fighters make it safely
to the fields for the Final Round?

00:23:50.450 --> 00:23:52.610
Next, on Mobile Fighter
G Gundam...

00:23:52.610 --> 00:23:56.620
The Final Battle Approaches!
Only 3 Days Away

00:23:54.910 --> 00:24:01.790
The Final Battle Approaches!
Only 3 Days Away

00:23:56.620 --> 00:23:59.000
Ready! Go!
